# Desolace (Horde) - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 6 shipped flagged rares of Desolace, the
# 1480 item-start hunt, and its fixed containers. Run it in its own Polestar
# tab at the end of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a
# rare that is not up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose
# SOLE dropper is the rare. The in-band Cursed Centaur ships as a kill-note
# rare (Fingat pattern: generic loot only, no quest link) - the Alliances
# above-band exclusion does not transfer to the 31-45 Horde band (see
# docs/desolace-horde-companions-inventory.md). No tame lines ship (the data
# has no tameability flag and the core guide carries no tame corroboration -
# see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed
# anywhere, so none are stated. No shipped rare is a giver, ender, or
# objective of any core-contracted quest, and none drops a core quest item -
# so this round carries no overlap notes except the shared Burning Blade
# camp, said plainly on the hunt step.
guide butler-routes-completionist/desolace-horde-rares
title Desolace (Horde) - Rares & Treasures
levels 31-45
zone Desolace
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords desolace, horde, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Accursed Slitherblade - the north-west

  zone map 1443

  goto 42.17,19.01
  kill 14229 optional -- Accursed Slitherblade, in the north-west
  collect 284713 "Accursed Legguards" optional
  note Level 35 rare at its single confirmed point in the north-west; its sole drop is the Accursed Legguards. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

