  kill 11688 optional -- Cursed Centaur, in the west
  note Level 43 rare at its single confirmed point in the west, inside the 31-45 band; the data shows no sole drop for it and it drops no quest item, so there is nothing to collect. No quest takes it.
  note Drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step North-center - the Burning Blade skins (1480 hunt)

  zone map 1443

  loop
  goto 52.08,28.86
  goto 54.03,30.39
  goto 55.14,28.62
  goto 56.09,29.16
  goto 56.86,25.66
  goto 57.49,26.00
  kill 4663 optional -- Burning Blade Augur, in the north-center camp
  kill 4664 optional -- Burning Blade Reaver, in the north-center camp
  kill 4665 optional -- Burning Blade Adept, in the north-center camp
  kill 4666 optional -- Burning Blade Felsworn, in the north-center camp
  kill 4667 optional -- Burning Blade Shadowmage, in the north-center camp
  kill 13019 optional -- Burning Blade Seer, in the north-center camp
  collect 20310 optional -- Flayed Demon Skin off the Burning Blade, the 1480 starter
  collect 6766 optional -- Flayed Demon Skin (old variant) off the Burning Blade, the 1480 starter
  note Either skin starts quest 1480 (The Corrupter) in the core guide desolace-horde.guide - the accept and turn-in live there; one skin is enough. The same kills feed the cores 1435 gem farm.
  note Summoner 4668 and Invoker 4705 also carry the skins but spawn on 1412 too - this loop stays on the 1443-only camp.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

